            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ayla"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is good on salad, pasta, pizza and just about anything that needs extra seasoning.",
            "datePublished": "2015-07-30T07:37:39.500Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gloria1967"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this tonight to put on a salad and it was pretty good. It gave it a flavor blast of goodness. I also cut the salt in half and it was perfect. Thanks Misti Jackson.",
            "datePublished": "2013-10-12T17:35:40.187Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nikki"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this tonight for my pasta. I didn't put in parmesan cheese (because I don't like it), I cut back the salt to 1 1/4 teaspoons, and added a pinch more pepper. After using it on my pasta, I do believe that it had a little too much garlic as I ate my dinner a couple hours ago &amp; the garlic aftertaste is still very strong. But all the other herbs compliment eachother very well and I had all of them already in my cabinet! Thanks Misti for this great herb mix!!",
            "datePublished": "2008-01-09T18:20:54.510Z"
          }
